With <literal>html_plain.css</literal>, the layout is similar to <title_reference>html4css1</title_reference>:</paragraph><field_list classes="open"><field><field_name>A long field name</field_name><field_body><paragraph>sticks into the field body.</paragraph><paragraph>The field body is pushed to the next line (you can suppress this
