of the <title_reference>field-name-limit</title_reference> configuration setting, for
example:</paragraph><literal_block xml:space="preserve">dl.field-list &gt; dd { margin-left: 6em; }</literal_block></field_body></field><field><field_name>Empty</field_name><field_body></field_body></field><field><field_name>fields</field_name><field_body><paragraph>must not lead to misalignment of the following content.</paragraph></field_body></field></field_list></section><section ids="styling-with-class-arguments" names="styling\ with\ class\ arguments"><title>Styling with Class Arguments</title><paragraph>The <literal>plain.css</literal> style sheet comes with some pre-defined style variants
